  "prompt": "Create a normalized Minecraft block model for a Full Send arctic crossing pond tray. This unit model will be stretched to 5 blocks wide and 2 deep, height unchanged. All coordinates within 0..16. Four dark blue ice/snow rim walls near edges to height Y=10; rich opaque deep blue water surface exactly Y=6 inside, tray bottom at Y=0. Tiny pixel ripples and frosty edge trim. No ice floes, no animals, no writing, no labels: those are separately animated. Clean premium voxel arcade attraction, top visible from above.",
